{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IcQfloYJCo1794838180.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地明年參與招收香港中學文憑試(DSE)學生的高等院校，增加至169間。</p><p></p><p>新增的院校有4間，包括浙江財經大學、麗水學院，福建福耀科技大學及廣州新華學院。</p><p></p><p>教育局稱，內地高校會根據文憑考試成績，擇優錄取香港學生，免去學生參與內地聯招考試。政府亦鼓勵香港學生到內地升學，認識國家，規劃發展路徑。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.DSE-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PeQIo8c6F71794838186.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>內地63間高校從2012年起對香港學生豁免內地聯招考試。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:59:29.194333+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T17:11:05.923250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:52:54.643133+00:00","content_hash":"9deee53aa1de1bfdfebac43e61f51b8fe9fb7f6670fb2d8e0bd5eb623fe8c25f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:59:29.194333+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}